Subject: [PATCH 1/2] mcp: match allowed server URLs to the fetch destination

Compare HTTP(S) MCP allowlist patterns against the WHATWG URL destination
instead of the raw configured string.

- Canonicalize HTTP(S) candidate URLs with the URL parser and match
  origin, path, and query
- Treat reverse solidus as an authority terminator in URL patterns
- Restrict authority wildcards so they do not consume userinfo or path
  separators
- Add unit tests for alternate URL spellings and unparseable input

