Subject: [PATCH 2/2] mcp: normalize allowlist URL patterns to the fetch
 destination

Apply the same HTTP(S) destination form to policy patterns as to candidate
URLs so default ports and origin-only entries keep matching.

- Strip a default port from HTTP(S) patterns and add a root path when
  the pattern has no path
- Treat a wildcard port as optional after default-port removal
- Add tests for origin-only patterns and explicit default ports

